---
title: "Amsterdam Noord 3D CPT Webmap"
description: "Interactive 3D visualization of Cone Penetration Test data from Amsterdam Noord, Netherlands"
---

This example displays Cone Penetration Test data from the [Basisregistratie Ondergrond](https://basisregistratieondergrond.nl/) from Amsterdam Noord in 3D using [CesiumJS](https://cesium.com/platform/cesiumjs/).
The map shows CPT locations with the interpreted soil types following Robertson (2010) classification.

This example also includes 3D Buildings from the [3DBag](https://3dbag.nl/en/viewer) as [3DTiles](https://cesium.com/why-cesium/3d-tiles/) and [GeoTOP](https://basisregistratieondergrond.nl/inhoud-bro/registratieobjecten/modellen/geotop-gtm/), a geological block model of the shallow subsurface of the Netherlands as 3DTiles with voxels.

